; The library under test: two inert instrumentation stanzas, committed
; once — zero overhead until --instrument-with, or the workspace's
; instrument_with (../dune-workspace), asks for them — and no PPX or
; test code in lib/ itself. Coverage is spelled ppx_windtrap.coverage,
; not the bare ppx_windtrap: both resolve the same rewriter, but the
; bare spelling's ppx_runtime_libraries link the windtrap core into an
; instrumented library's closure (ppx/coverage/dune argues it; "prefer
; the second in new code").

(library
 (name windtrap_example_blueprint)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
